          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "Over 90% of home buyers and real estate investors start their property search online via Google, Meta Ads, and YouTube walkthrough videos. Digital marketing positions your housing project or real estate agency at the exact moment buyers search, driving pre-screened site visit leads."
